msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:571
msgid "This pairing key no longer works on the live site: it expired, or the pairing was rejected or revoked there. Create a new key on the live site."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:573
msgid "The live site no longer accepts this pairing (it was revoked, expired, or reset when Keepmerge was deactivated there). Revoke it here and connect again with a new key."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:575
msgid "The live site no longer has this pairing's receiver account: the pairing was revoked or rejected there, it expired, or it was reset when Keepmerge was deactivated on live. Revoke it here and connect again with a new key if you still want to push."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:577
msgid "The live site no longer accepts this site's credentials (they were reset there, for example when Keepmerge was deactivated on live). Revoke the pairing here and connect again with a new key."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:579
msgid "The live site has not approved this site yet."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:579
msgid "Approve the staging site there."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:581
msgid "The clocks of the two servers differ by more than 5 minutes. Ask the host of the site whose clock is wrong to synchronise it (NTP), then try again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:583
msgid "The live site refused this site's request signature: the stored secret no longer matches (for example after a database restore). Revoke the pairing here and connect again with a new key."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:585
msgid "The live site did not accept this site's credentials. If Application Passwords were turned off on live (often by a security plugin), turn them on again; otherwise revoke the pairing here and connect again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:587
msgid "The live site says the request did not arrive over HTTPS. Make sure the live site is served over HTTPS end to end, including any proxy in front of it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:589
msgid "The Authorization header does not reach WordPress on the live site: the web server or a proxy removes it. Ask the host to pass it to PHP (on Apache: CGIPassAuth On, or a SetEnvIf Authorization rule in .htaccess)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:591
msgid "Too many requests in one minute. Wait a minute and try again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:593
msgid "The live site has blocked this server's address for 15 minutes after repeated failed attempts. Wait, then try again; the live site's audit log shows what failed."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:595
msgid "The live site saw the same request twice and refused the second. Try again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:597
msgid "The live site expects this pairing from another address or site ID (its IP pin, or a copied database). Check the IP pin on live, or connect again with a new key."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:602
msgid "The live site did not understand the request. Make sure both sites run the same version of Keepmerge."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:604
msgid "This key belongs to this site itself. Create the key on the live site."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:606
msgid "Another push session is open on the live site, so it does not accept a second one. If it is an earlier push from this site, abort it on this Send tab; otherwise wait until it ends. A push that is never applied expires on live after 24 hours."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:608
msgid "The live site released this push's lock (for example because Keepmerge was deactivated there), so it stopped accepting items for it. Abort this push and push again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:613
msgid "The live site no longer has this push session (it expired after 24 hours, was aborted, or was set aside). Create a new plan and push again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:615
msgid "The live site already has a different push with this identifier. Create a new plan and push again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:620
msgid "The live site refused this batch because it does not fit the push it has on record. Abort this push, then plan and push again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:622
msgid "The live site is already applying this push, so it can no longer be aborted from here."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:626
msgid "The items the live site received do not match the plan, so live set this push aside and changes nothing. Create a new plan and push again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:628
msgid "The live site does not have room for the media of this push: its free disk space is too low, or the media are above the per-push limit (2 GB). Free space on live, or plan again with fewer media, then push again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:630
msgid "The live site cannot write the temporary files of this push: WordPress cannot write directly into its uploads folder (wrong permissions, or a setup that asks for FTP credentials). Fix the permissions of the uploads folder on live, then resume."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:632
msgid "The media of this push are above the limit of 2 GB per push. Plan again with \"Only some kinds\" or fewer media, and push in parts."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:634
msgid "The live site refused a file path in this push."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:636
msgid "A file of this push is larger than the live site accepts (512 MB per file)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:648
msgid "The live site refused the files of this push because they do not fit the push it has on record. Abort this push, then plan and push again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:650
msgid "A part of a file arrived on live damaged several times in a row. Check the network between the two sites, then resume."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:652
msgid "Keepmerge refused to connect: the live site's address resolves to a private, local or reserved network address, or to this site itself. Use the live site's public HTTPS address (port 443) in the pairing key, then connect again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:654
msgid "The live site stopped this request at its time or memory limit before doing any more work. Keepmerge sends smaller batches and tries again; if this repeats, raise PHP's memory_limit on live or resume later."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:656
msgid "A step of this push is running on the live site right now. The next step asks again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:659
msgid "An item could not be written on live, so live stopped the push there. A live administrator decides on live's Pushes screen: retry the item, skip it, or roll the push back. Then use \"Check status\" here."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:661
msgid "The apply on live stopped without finishing (live lost its heartbeat, its receive window was closed, or the pairing was revoked). A live administrator resumes it or rolls it back on live's Pushes screen. Then use \"Check status\" here."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:664
msgid "A live administrator rolled this push back on live. Live now holds what it had before the push. Create a new plan to push again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:666
msgid "The live site does not allow code report requests. Switch on \"Allow code report requests\" in the live site's Settings tab to see the report."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:668
msgid "The request did not use PHP's cURL transport (another plugin or the server setup changed WordPress's HTTP transport), so Keepmerge could not make sure it went to the checked address. The answer was discarded. Make sure the cURL extension is enabled and that no plugin replaces the HTTP transport."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:671
msgid "The live site's answer was not signed with this pairing's secret, so it was discarded. If this repeats, something between the two sites changes the answers: connect again with a new key and check the network path."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %d: HTTP status code.
#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:676
#, php-format
msgid "The live site answered with a redirect (HTTP %d). Keepmerge does not follow redirects. Create the key on the live site at its own address (the one in its WordPress Address setting) and paste that key."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:678
msgid "The live site's HTTPS certificate could not be verified. Keepmerge connects only to sites with a valid certificate: fix the certificate on live, or the certificate bundle on this server."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:680
msgid "The live site could not be reached from this server. Check that it is online and that this server may connect to it, then try again."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %d: HTTP status code.
#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:683
#, php-format
msgid "The live site answered with a server error (HTTP %d). Check its PHP error log, then try again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:685
msgid "This request cannot be signed. Try again."
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: HTTP status code, 2: error code.
#: includes/transfer/class-remote-client.php:688
#, php-format
msgid "The live site refused the request (HTTP %1$d, %2$s)."
msgstr ""

